    [Misc] Add check for batch-sharded and pcp lmhead weight sharding (#17725)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR adds a validation check to prevent enabling `batch-sharded
    sampling` and `enable_pcp_embedding_lmhead_weight_sharding`
    simultaneously when Prefill Context Parallelism (PCP) is enabled, as
    these features are incompatible. It also updates the additional
    configuration documentation to document this incompatibility.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Yes, it adds a validation check that raises a `ValueError` if both
    `batch-sharded sampling` and
    `enable_pcp_embedding_lmhead_weight_sharding` are enabled with PCP.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Tested by verifying configuration validation logic.
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
    Signed-off-by: zouzy <zouzongyu@huawei.com>

